{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8741170F","title":"Ava Aspetic 3","entry":"Dlg_8741170F::entry","exit":"Dlg_8741170F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_191EE055","articyId":"72057615512782658","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"This audio-log could be promising, would you like me to patch it through?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This audio-log could be promising, would you like me to patch it through?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":750.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31284","byteOffset":19716016,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_21C58E5F","articyId":"72057615512782665","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yes please.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes please.","TextSheVersion":"Yes please.","TextTheyVersion":"Yes please."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23720","byteOffset":16855120,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_DC0A676A","articyId":"72057615512782671","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Could you sum this up in a sentence.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could you sum this up in a sentence.","TextSheVersion":"Could you sum this up in a sentence.","TextTheyVersion":"Could you sum this up in a sentence."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30943","byteOffset":19589168,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_3F02A5A5","articyId":"72057615512782679","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Audio Log","text":"I've been doing this a long time now. The mountain just seems to get taller. With all this Aseptic stuff happening, I just feel like I'm going to be high up on his list. Some people are saying he's only going after debt-orphans and you don't get much more debt-orphaned than me.","speakerId":"Ntt_3D43EFDC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've been doing this a long time now. The mountain just seems to get taller. With all this Aseptic stuff happening, I just feel like I'm going to be high up on his list. Some people are saying he's only going after debt-orphans and you don't get much more debt-orphaned than me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18684","byteOffset":14955032,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_5B225751","articyId":"72057615512782686","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"This feels sad. Would you like me to give you space?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This feels sad. Would you like me to give you space?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18530","byteOffset":14895904,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_6C419B77","articyId":"72057615512782693","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'll be ok.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll be ok.","TextSheVersion":"I'll be ok.","TextTheyVersion":"I'll be ok."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38244","byteOffset":28804168,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_1D4CBDD5","articyId":"72057615512782700","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'm very glad to hear that! In light of this, I have taken the liberty of searching for the phrase 'Crusty Punk' Would you like the information?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm very glad to hear that! In light of this, I have taken the liberty of searching for the phrase 'Crusty Punk' Would you like the information?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40892","byteOffset":29797136,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_77AFBAB8","articyId":"72057615512782707","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure.","TextSheVersion":"Sure.","TextTheyVersion":"Sure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37354","byteOffset":28470496,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_D22BBFEC","articyId":"72057615512782714","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"After sifting through some... Questionable sexual content... I found reference to a now defunct rail gang called the Crusty Punks in a blog from someone called McFellow. Seems to be some kind of rail transport expert.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"After sifting through some... Questionable sexual content... I found reference to a now defunct rail gang called the Crusty Punks in a blog from someone called McFellow. Seems to be some kind of rail transport expert.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49616","byteOffset":33112816,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_9B512D8A","articyId":"72057615512806595","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What about Huckstash?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What about Huckstash?","TextSheVersion":"What about Huckstash?","TextTheyVersion":"What about Huckstash?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4325.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51825","byteOffset":34022712,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_078541F6","articyId":"72057615512806602","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'm so sorry, no results I'm afraid.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm so sorry, no results I'm afraid.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4625.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24283","byteOffset":17063816,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_FA9862DD","articyId":"72057615512920897","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"It's quite sad really. The victim was about to run away with some kind of group called the Crusty Punks. Mentioned someone there called Huckstash.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's quite sad really. The victim was about to run away with some kind of group called the Crusty Punks. Mentioned someone there called Huckstash.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32384","byteOffset":20133392,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_DF7D31D5","articyId":"72057615512920904","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Able to search them?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Able to search them?","TextSheVersion":"Able to search them?","TextTheyVersion":"Able t